        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions GRT150SBR, 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Acrylic Retro Door Pull </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Retro Acrylic Door Pull is available in 3 sizes: 18 inches, 24 inches, and 36 inches. The retro-styled mounts bring real character to this handle. They are made out of brass and available in a myriad of finishes. The acrylic grip is available in either clear or frosted. This 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Acrylic Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Retro Acrylic Door Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Clear or Frosted Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GRT01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262333\"><b>First Impressions GRT150SBR Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-GRT150018SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-GRT150024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-GRT150036SBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 28\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Retro Acrylic Door Pull",
                "description": "The Retro Acrylic Door Pull is available in 3 sizes: 18 inches, 24 inches, and 36 inches. The retro-styled mounts bring real character to this handle. They are made out of brass and available in a myriad of finishes. The acrylic grip is available in either clear or frosted. This 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Acrylic Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, glass, or metal doors.",
